Comparison

  Unit test         fast, internal logic
  Contract test     fast, interface between consumer + provider
  Integration test  slower, real dependency (DB, broker)
  End-to-end test   slow, flaky, whole system (use sparingly)

Anti-patterns

  - testing every field a provider returns (defeats additive evolution)
  - one global pact for all consumers (loses consumer-specific needs)
  - contract testing instead of all other tests (it is additive)

